legend right
  **Color Legend:**
  |= Color |= Entity Type |
  | <back:#E8F5E9>   </back> | Cart Management |
  | <back:#FFF3E0>   </back> | Order Management |
  | <back:#FCE4EC>   </back> | Payment Processing |
  | <back:#E3F2FD>   </back> | Address Management |
  | <back:#F3E5F5>   </back> | User Management |
  | <back:#E0F2F1>   </back> | Product/Stock Integration |
  | <back:#FFF9C4>   </back> | Notification System |
  
  **Key Points:**
  - NULL-able foreign keys support guest users
  - JSON fields store flexible data
  - Status history provides audit trail
  - Address tables separate for data preservation
  - Stock movements track all inventory changes
  
  **Total Tables:** 17
  - Core: 9 (Cart, Order, Payment related)
  - Supporting: 8 (Address, Stock, Notification, Session)
endlegend

@enduml
